{"id":"d213081546a4e6fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-stepr.md","title":"Step-by-step Extension","display":"thm-stepr — Step-by-step Extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-stepr","aliases":["58-thm-stepr"],"display":"thm-stepr — Step-by-step Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-stepr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-stepr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stepr — Step-by-step Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> 为偏序集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle U_n:n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega\">\\(\\langle U_n:n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1}\">\\(U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_\\omega\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}U_n\">\\(U_\\omega\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}U_n\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stepr} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\langle U_n:n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega\\land U_\\omega=\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}U_n\\land\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)\\land U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1})\\Bigr)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_\\omega,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;(U_n\\subseteq U_\\omega)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stepr} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\langle U_n:n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega\\land U_\\omega=\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}U_n\\land\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)\\land U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1})\\Bigr)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_\\omega,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;(U_n\\subseteq U_\\omega)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>递增滤子的逐步并仍是滤子，因为滤子公理只要求有限次共同加强。</li>\n<li>该结论不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_\\omega\">\\(U_\\omega\\)</span> 是超滤子或可列完备；旧断言在没有任何大基数假设时凭空声称存在嵌套的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_n\">\\(\\kappa_n\\)</span>-完备超滤子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle U_n:n<\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega$，满足 $\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)$ 且 $U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1}$（see [[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle U_n:n<\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"U_\\omega\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stepr} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\langle U_n:n<\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathcal P(P))^\\omega\\land U_\\omega=\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}U_n\\land\\forall n<\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_n,P,\\leq_P)\\land U_n\\subseteq U_{n+1})\\Bigr)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(U_\\omega,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall n<\\omega\\;(U_n\\subseteq U_\\omega)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"U_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_n","display":false}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4440","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-stepr.md|58-thm-stepr]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["1331244a5201bb99"]}